<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">COURSE HANDOUTS</view><view class="page-title">讲义寄送<text class="title-dot">.</text></view><view class="subtitle">查看寄送进度，安心等待讲义送达</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在获取寄送信息…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card error-card">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{eligibleOrders.length}}" class="section-head"><view class="section-title">可申请寄送</view></view><view wx:for="{{eligibleOrders}}" wx:key="id" class="request-card card"><view class="course-title">{{item.courseTitle}}</view><view class="small muted">已付款 · 含实物讲义寄送</view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="requestShipment">申请讲义寄送</button></view><view wx:if="{{shipments.length}}" class="section-head"><view class="section-title">寄送记录</view></view><view wx:for="{{shipments}}" wx:key="id" class="shipment-card card"><view class="between"><view class="course-title">{{item.courseTitle}}</view><text class="shipment-status {{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="small muted shipment-date">申请于 {{item.dateText}}</view><view class="address-block"><view>{{item.address.recipient}} <text>{{item.address.phone}}</text></view><view>{{item.address.province}}{{item.address.city}}{{item.address.district}} {{item.address.detail}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.trackingNumber}}" class="tracking-info"><view>快递公司 <text>{{item.courierName}}</text></view><view data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="copyTracking">快递单号 <text>{{item.trackingNumber}}</text> <text class="copy-label">复制</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="shipment-note">寄送备注：{{item.note}}</view><view class="shipment-actions"><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'pending'}}" class="ghost" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="changeAddress">更换寄送地址</button><button wx:if="{{item.trackingNumber}}" class="ghost" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tracking">查看物流</button><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'shipped'}}" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="receive" disabled="{{receivingId}}">{{receivingId === item.id ? '提交中' : '确认收货'}}</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{!eligibleOrders.length && !shipments.length}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-icon">▣</view><view class="empty-title">暂无讲义寄送记录</view><view class="empty-copy">购买包含实物讲义的课程后，可在这里申请寄送</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="orders">查看我的订单</button></view><button class="ghost manage-address" bindtap="addresses">管理收货地址</button><view class="notice">只有明确包含实物讲义的已付款课程支持寄送。每个订单可申请一次；发货前可以更换地址。</view></block></view>
<view wx:if="{{editing}}" class="dialog-mask" catchtouchmove="stop"><view class="dialog-card"><view class="dialog-title">{{editShipmentId ? '更换寄送地址' : '申请讲义寄送'}}</view><view class="dialog-copy">{{selectedOrder.courseTitle}}</view><view wx:if="{{addresses.length}}"><view class="field-label">选择收货地址</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{addressLabels}}" value="{{addressIndex}}" bindchange="selectAddress" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="address-picker">{{addressIndex >= 0 ? addressLabels[addressIndex] : '请选择收货地址'}} <text>›</text></view></picker><view class="dialog-copy">提交后会保存本次寄送的地址。收件信息用于讲义寄送，查询物流时会向快递100提供快递单号和收件手机号。修改地址簿不会自动改变寄送申请。</view></view><view wx:else class="dialog-copy">请先添加收货地址，再回来提交寄送申请。</view><button class="ghost dialog-address" bindtap="addresses" disabled="{{saving}}">{{addresses.length ? '新增 / 编辑收货地址' : '添加收货地址'}}</button><view wx:if="{{formError}}" class="form-error">{{formError}}</view><button wx:if="{{addresses.length}}" class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">{{editShipmentId ? '保存寄送地址' : '确认申请寄送'}}</button><button class="dialog-cancel" bindtap="close" disabled="{{saving}}">取消</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{trackingId}}" class="dialog-mask" catchtouchmove="stop"><view class="dialog-card"><view class="dialog-title">物流信息</view><view wx:if="{{trackingLoading}}" class="loading">正在查询快递轨迹…</view><view wx:elif="{{trackingError}}" class="form-error">{{trackingError}}</view><block wx:elif="{{tracking}}"><view class="dialog-copy">{{tracking.courierName}} {{tracking.trackingNumber}}</view><view wx:if="{{tracking.message}}" class="notice">{{tracking.message}}</view><view wx:for="{{tracking.events}}" wx:key="index" class="tracking-event"><view class="event-time">{{item.time}}</view><view>{{item.context}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!tracking.events.length && !tracking.message}}" class="dialog-copy">暂无快递轨迹，请稍后查询或联系老师。</view></block><button class="dialog-cancel" bindtap="closeTracking">关闭</button></view></view>
